OL,3,GNEWSA'I love being a role model', says
OL,4,Ateen after TV performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager with Down's syndrome says
OL,7,Fdancing on national TV for the BBC
OL,8,FChildren in Need appeal programme "felt
OL,9,Finspirational".
OL,11,FZoe, who is from Fleet in Hampshire,
OL,12,Fjoined the cast of Disney's High School
OL,13,FMusical for a performance of We're All
OL,14,Fin This Together on Friday evening.
OL,16,FThe 16-year-old spent weeks preparing
OL,17,Fas part of the The One Show's challenge
OL,18,Fsquad.
