OL,3,GNEWSA'I love being a role model', says
OL,4,Ateen after TV performance
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It felt uplifting, it felt
OL,7,Finspirational, it felt amazing, it felt
OL,8,Fmoving, it felt just incredible," said
OL,9,FZoe.
